# Line endings are deterministic here, not a function of who cloned it.
#
# The CSV corpora are EVIDENCE. Every scored prediction in
# REAL_DASHBOARDS.md and the four pre-registrations is only checkable
# against the exact bytes they were scored on, so git must not rewrite
# them on the way in or out.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.csv   -text
*.png   binary
*.svg   -text

# The worksheet is written utf-8-sig for Excel; normalising it would
# defeat the BOM.
*-worksheet.csv -text
